		<name>Andromi Auto</name>
		<summary>Android Auto on the phone, shown on a Xiaomi car screen</summary>
		<desc>Andromi Auto runs Android Auto on your phone and shows it in its own window, so HyperOS
&quot;Xiaomi Interconnectivity&quot; can mirror it to the car screen.

* Self mode: no USB cable or wireless head unit needed
* Material 3 design with wallpaper (Monet) colours
* Portrait and landscape switch for the different car window sizes
* Optional automatic start when the car's Bluetooth connects (needs root setup)
* Built-in update check for stable releases

Based on Open Headunit (AGPL-3.0). Unofficial; not affiliated with Google, Xiaomi or Baidu.
Uses the install id com.baidu.searchbox, so it cannot be installed next to the real Baidu app.</desc>
