		<name>XEU Forums</name>
		<summary>Unofficial app for the Xiaomi.EU community forum</summary>
		<desc>XEU Forums is an unofficial Android app for the Xiaomi.EU community forum.

* Browse every forum and thread in a clean Material 3 design, in light and dark mode
* Search threads and posts, and jump to new posts
* My devices: follow the phones you own and get one feed of their forums
* Log in, reply, quote and start threads, and switch between several accounts
* Alerts, direct messages and watched threads inside the app
* Notifications for forum alerts and new direct messages

Not affiliated with Xiaomi or Xiaomi.EU.</desc>
